# Configure AdminToken in your HTTP client's PRIVATE environment, never in this file.
# It must match Admin__ApiKey in the API process. See docs/api/ADMIN.md.
# Examples are local only; use HTTPS outside loopback. Never enable Authorization logging.
@AdminHost = http://localhost:5078
@DeviceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@DefinitionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List drafts (all statuses when status is omitted)
GET {{AdminHost}}/api/v1/admin/devices?status=draft&page=1&pageSize=24
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}

### Reference IDs for device editing
GET {{AdminHost}}/api/v1/admin/brands
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}

###
GET {{AdminHost}}/api/v1/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}

###
GET {{AdminHost}}/api/v1/admin/comparison-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}

###
GET {{AdminHost}}/api/v1/admin/specification-definitions?pageSize=100
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}

### Create a draft: replace brand/category IDs with existing references.
POST {{AdminHost}}/api/v1/admin/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Editorial device",
  "slug": "editorial-device",
  "brandId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "categoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Read before editing: PUT uses the data.content object as its body, not the entire response.
GET {{AdminHost}}/api/v1/admin/devices/{{DeviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}

### Full replacement of content fields; copy current IDs/metadata first to avoid resetting fields.
PUT {{AdminHost}}/api/v1/admin/devices/{{DeviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Editorial device",
  "slug": "editorial-device",
  "brandId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "categoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "shortDescription": "Summary",
  "description": "Overview",
  "history": "Historical context",
  "seoTitle": "Editorial device | TechVault",
  "seoDescription": "Historical device overview",
  "aliases": [],
  "releaseYear": 2000
}

### Choose an existing NUMBER definition; this changes only that specification.
PUT {{AdminHost}}/api/v1/admin/devices/{{DeviceId}}/specifications/{{DefinitionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "valueNumber": 0 }

### Requires complete descriptive/history/SEO content.
POST {{AdminHost}}/api/v1/admin/devices/{{DeviceId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}

### Hide without deleting content.
POST {{AdminHost}}/api/v1/admin/devices/{{DeviceId}}/unpublish
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}

### Archive (read-only afterward). This does NOT physically delete the device.
DELETE {{AdminHost}}/api/v1/admin/devices/{{DeviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}
